<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Anangel Ambition - 140,000 tonnes coal Hay Point/Iskenderun mid Aug $10.25 fio 50,000 shinc/15,000 shex BHP.</p>
<p>ORE - George - 70,000 tonnes ore Tubara/Ghent 23/31 July $7.20 fio five days shinc Sidmar.</p>
<p>TBN - 45,000/10 tonnes bauxite Kamsar/Point Comfort 20/27 July $5.30 fio 24,000 shinc/15,000 shinc Premuda.</p>
</text>
